    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Shoulder pain is a fairly common problem and affects the patient's daily activities and work routine. The two groups that suffer most from this problem are middle-aged or elderly patients and sportsmen.\" This was stated by Dr M.A. Wajid, Consultant Orthopaedic Surgeon, at 'Signs, Symptoms and Care', a health awareness programme held at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) on December 4, 2004 in Karachi.",
